      "category": "etymology",
      "quality": "good"
    },
    {
      "id": 2,
      "text": "The Paluxy River, a 29‑mile tributary of the Brazos, begins where the North and South Paluxy Rivers meet near Bluff Dale.",
      "sourceSentenceIds": [
