      "category": "nature",
      "quality": "good"
    },
    {
      "id": 3,
      "text": "In the 1930s locals claimed to find human footprints in the Glen Rose Formation, sparking a famous debate over the geological time scale.",
      "sourceSentenceIds": [
        26
      ],
      "sourceLabels": [
        "Wikipedia"
      ],
      "source": "https://en.wikipedia.org/wiki/Paluxy_River",
      "category": "history",
      "quality": "good"
    },
    {
      "id": 4,
      "text": "Scientists later determined those so‑called human tracks were actually elongated dinosaur footprints, river scour marks, or hoaxes.",
      "sourceSentenceIds": [
        27
